Subject: call same function for different resources several times
Message-ID: <Flc98tfXRqY.NOCvx0UBAgAJ@simmer-devel.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/simmer-devel/c/Flc98tfXRqY/m/NOCvx0UBAgAJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
